  "Operating loss": "Rugi operasi",
  "Revenue fell approximately 22%": "Pendapatan turun sekitar 22%",
  "Rp billion · sales before costs": "Rp miliar · penjualan sebelum biaya",
  "Sales fell Rp1,908.1bn, from Rp8,654.6bn to Rp6,746.6bn (−22.0%). The decline describes performance; its causes require assessment.": "Penjualan turun Rp1.908,1 miliar, dari Rp8.654,6 miliar menjadi Rp6.746,6 miliar (−22,0%). Penurunan ini menggambarkan kinerja; penyebabnya perlu diteliti.",
  "Liquidity comparison": "Perbandingan likuiditas",
