  "The strategic question": "Pertanyaan strategis",
  "MPPA faces continuing operating losses and limited financial capacity, while Hypermart supplies approximately 85% of revenue.": "MPPA menghadapi rugi operasi berkelanjutan dan kapasitas keuangan terbatas, sementara Hypermart menyumbang sekitar 85% pendapatan.",
  "How should MPPA allocate resources across store formats and online channels to achieve sustainable profitability?": "Bagaimana MPPA sebaiknya mengalokasikan sumber daya antarformat gerai dan kanal daring untuk mencapai profitabilitas berkelanjutan?",
  "A working problem statement to test through external and internal analysis.": "Rumusan masalah sementara untuk diuji melalui analisis eksternal dan internal.",
  "Source: case pp. 588–590, Exhibits 2, 3 & 5 · Financial values rounded for display": "Sumber: kasus hlm. 588–590, Eksibit 2, 3 & 5 · Nilai keuangan dibulatkan untuk tampilan",
  "MPPA recorded operating losses in 2019 and 2020. Revenue fell about 22 percent, while the operating loss narrowed from Rp196.1 billion to Rp140.3 billion. Interest expense increased, and loss before tax worsened. Current liabilities exceeded current assets by Rp1.228 trillion at year-end 2020. Hypermart’s 85 percent revenue share explains the importance of its performance; it does not prove concentration caused the losses. Compare resource allocation options before choosing a strategy.": "MPPA mencatat rugi operasi pada 2019 dan 2020. Pendapatan turun sekitar 22 persen, sedangkan rugi operasi menyusut dari Rp196,1 miliar menjadi Rp140,3 miliar. Beban bunga meningkat dan rugi sebelum pajak memburuk. Liabilitas lancar melampaui aset lancar sebesar Rp1,228 triliun pada akhir 2020. Pangsa Hypermart sebesar 85 persen menunjukkan pentingnya format tersebut, bukan membuktikan bahwa konsentrasi menyebabkan kerugian. Bandingkan alternatif alokasi sumber daya sebelum memilih strategi.",
  "Operating losses continued": "Rugi operasi berlanjut",
  "Rp billion · absolute loss amounts, not profit": "Rp miliar · nilai absolut kerugian, bukan laba",
  "Operating loss fell Rp55.8bn: Rp196.1bn in 2019 versus Rp140.3bn in 2020 (−28.5%). EBIT improved, but remained negative.": "Rugi operasi turun Rp55,8 miliar: Rp196,1 miliar pada 2019 dibandingkan Rp140,3 miliar pada 2020 (−28,5%). EBIT membaik, tetapi tetap negatif.",
  "Interest expense rose approximately 126%": "Beban bunga naik sekitar 126%",
  "Rp billion · financing expense": "Rp miliar · beban pendanaan",
  "Interest expense increased Rp148.9bn, versus a Rp55.8bn improvement in EBIT. The Rp93.1bn difference raised pretax loss from Rp314.6bn to Rp407.7bn.": "Beban bunga meningkat Rp148,9 miliar, dibandingkan perbaikan EBIT Rp55,8 miliar. Selisih Rp93,1 miliar meningkatkan rugi sebelum pajak dari Rp314,6 miliar menjadi Rp407,7 miliar.",
