  "Current ratio (0.72x = 2), Debt-to-Equity (10.5x = 1), Net losses (-Rp887.5B = 1), Revenue decline (-21.9% = 2), Inventory turnover (47.9 days = 3). Severe financial pressure from 4 consecutive loss years.": "Rasio lancar (0,72x = 2), Utang/Ekuitas (10,5x = 1), Kerugian bersih (-Rp887,5M = 1), Penurunan pendapatan (-21,9% = 2), Perputaran persediaan (47,9 hari = 3). Tekanan keuangan berat dari 4 tahun rugi berturut-turut.",
