  "Alfamidi identifies permits, sites, funding and staffing as operating barriers. Its franchise model also provides smaller operators access to brand and procurement support.": "Alfamidi mengidentifikasi izin, lokasi, pendanaan dan tenaga kerja sebagai hambatan operasi. Model waralabanya juga menyediakan akses dukungan merek dan pengadaan bagi operator kecil.",
