  "The logistics advantage is MPPA management’s stated assessment, supported by its disclosed infrastructure. It is not a guarantee against entry or proof that every new outlet took MPPA sales.": "Keunggulan logistik merupakan penilaian manajemen MPPA yang didukung pengungkapan infrastruktur. Ini bukan jaminan terhadap pendatang atau bukti setiap gerai baru mengambil penjualan MPPA.",
  "Restaurant and delivery meals offer an alternative to cooking. Nielsen’s early-2020 study also reports more home cooking, so the direction of pressure is not uniform.": "Makanan restoran dan layanan antar menjadi alternatif memasak. Studi Nielsen awal 2020 juga melaporkan peningkatan memasak di rumah sehingga arah tekanannya tidak seragam.",
