  "Price rivalry and shoppers’ choice of retailers pressure MPPA’s sales. Its logistics network creates an entry barrier, while procurement supports its supplier position. Sources: MPPA 2020 report pp. 12, 38, 47–49, 115 and 126; David Chapter 3.": "Persaingan harga dan pilihan peritel menekan penjualan MPPA. Jaringan logistik menjadi hambatan masuk, sementara pengadaan mendukung posisi terhadap pemasok. Sumber: laporan MPPA 2020 hlm. 12, 38, 47–49, 115 dan 126; David Bab 3.",
