  "MPPA AR2020 p. 38": "Laporan Tahunan MPPA 2020 hal. 38",
  "Non-food migrated to e-commerce; MPPA fresh food increased revenue share.": "Barang non-makanan beralih ke e-commerce; makanan segar MPPA meningkatkan pangsa pendapatan.",
  "3. Format Substitution": "3. Substitusi Format Gerai",
  "94% minimarket outlet share": "Pangsa jumlah gerai minimarket 94%",
  "Case Exhibit 9, p. 593": "Kasus Lampiran 9, hal. 593",
  "Lockdowns redirected trips to neighborhood minimarkets (Indomaret/Alfamart) and supermarkets (Alfamidi).": "Kebijakan pembatasan wilayah mengalihkan belanja ke minimarket lingkungan (Indomaret/Alfamart) dan supermarket pemukiman (Alfamidi).",
  "Section 07 · Competitive assessment": "Bagian 07 · Penilaian kompetitif",
  "Competitive Profile Matrix (CPM) & Evidence Defense": "Matriks Profil Kompetitif (CPM) & Pertanggungjawaban Bukti",
  "The CPM compares MPPA’s consumer grocery business with five primary competitors across eight evidence-supported critical success factors for FY2020. Weights reflect industry importance during the pandemic (totaling 1.00); ratings use Fred David’s 1–4 response effectiveness scale.": "CPM membandingkan bisnis ritel bahan pangan MPPA dengan lima pesaing utama pada sembilan faktor penentu keberhasilan berbasis bukti untuk TA2020. Bobot mencerminkan tingkat kepentingan industri selama pandemi (total 1,00); peringkat menggunakan skala efektivitas respons 1–4 Fred David.",
  "1. Sourced Company-by-Factor Evidence Table (FY2020 Baseline)": "1. Tabel Bukti Perusahaan per Faktor Berdasarkan Sumber (Dasar TA2020)",
  "This evidence base establishes the factual foundation and defense for the CPM ratings before weights are applied:": "Basis bukti ini membangun fondasi faktual dan pertanggungjawaban untuk penilaian peringkat CPM sebelum bobot diterapkan:",
  "2. Competitive Profile Matrix (CPM) Scored Results": "2. Hasil Skor Matriks Profil Kompetitif (CPM)",
  "Sourced 9-factor evaluation following Fred David's framework. Weights sum to exactly 1.00; ratings reflect competitive responsiveness (1 = Major Weakness, 2 = Minor Weakness, 3 = Minor Strength, 4 = Major Strength).": "Evaluasi 9 faktor bersumber mengikuti kerangka kerja Fred David. Bobot berjumlah tepat 1,00; peringkat mencerminkan daya tanggap kompetitif (1 = Kelemahan Utama, 2 = Kelemahan Kecil, 3 = Kekuatan Kecil, 4 = Kekuatan Utama).",
  "MPPA": "MPPA",
  "3. Key Findings & Strategic Takeaways for MPPA": "3. Temuan Kunci & Kesimpulan Strategis bagi MPPA",
  "Connecting competitive findings to the case red thread:": "Menghubungkan temuan kompetitif dengan benang merah kasus:",
  "1. The Format Squeeze: Minimarkets (Indomaret & Alfamart, ~33,500 stores combined) dominate accessibility (0.56) and scale (0.52). MPPA's large hypermarkets suffered from mobility restrictions and high overhead.": "1. Himpitan Format: Minimarket (Indomaret & Alfamart, gabungan ~33.500 gerai) mendominasi aksesibilitas (0,56) dan skala (0,52). Hipermarket besar MPPA menderita akibat pembatasan mobilitas dan beban biaya ruang tinggi.",
  "2. The Fresh Differentiation Moat: Fresh food contributed 27.7% of sales (+3.7% YoY). MPPA's 3 cold-chain DCs (66,755 m²) provide an advantage over dry-grocery minimarkets.": "2. Parit Pertahanan Diferensiasi Makanan Segar: Pangan segar berkontribusi 27,7% terhadap penjualan (+3,7% YoY). 3 DC rantai dingin MPPA (66.755 m²) memberi keunggulan nyata dibanding minimarket yang hanya menjual barang kering.",
  "3. Omnichannel Agility vs. Native Scale: MPPA rapidly deployed GrabMart (97 stores), Shopee (45 stores), and WhatsApp (125 stores), generating 4.5% online sales from scratch.": "3. Kelincahan Omnichannel vs Skala Fisik: MPPA meluncurkan kemitraan kilat GrabMart (97 gerai), Shopee (45 gerai), dan WhatsApp (125 gerai), menghasilkan 4,5% penjualan online dari nol.",
  "4. The Balance Sheet Constraint: With negative working capital (-Rp1.23T) and bank debt (Rp1.03T), MPPA cannot wage an open price war, requiring targeted, asset-light execution.": "4. Kendala Neraca Finansial: Dengan modal kerja negatif (-Rp1,23T) dan utang bank (Rp1,03T), MPPA tidak dapat menggelar perang harga terbuka, melainkan butuh eksekusi ramping aset yang terfokus.",
  "Section 08 · Diagnostic foundation": "Bagian 08 · Fondasi diagnostik",
  "SWOT Analysis (Diagnostic Overview)": "Analisis SWOT (Fondasi Diagnostik)",
  "Comprehensive diagnostic foundation consisting of 40 verified factors (10 Strengths, 10 Weaknesses, 10 Opportunities, 10 Threats) adhering strictly to Fred David's rule ('Zero Kata Kerja' / noun phrases and verifiable metrics).": "Fondasi diagnostik komprehensif yang terdiri atas 40 faktor terverifikasi (10 Kekuatan, 10 Kelemahan, 10 Peluang, 10 Ancaman) yang mematuhi secara ketat aturan Fred David ('Tanpa Kata Kerja' / frasa nomina dan metrik terukur).",
  "Code": "Kode",
  "Category": "Kategori",
