  "Section 09 · External evaluation": "Bagian 09 · Evaluasi eksternal",
  "The EFE matrix assesses MPPA’s response to external economic, social, competitive, and regulatory opportunities and threats. Total score is 2.46 (against industry benchmark 2.50), reflecting strong omnichannel agility offset by hypermarket mall vulnerability.": "Matriks EFE menilai daya tanggap MPPA terhadap peluang dan ancaman ekonomi, sosial, kompetitif, dan regulasi. Total skor adalah 2,46 (berbanding tolok ukur rata-rata industri 2,50), mencerminkan kelincahan omnichannel yang kuat namun diimbangi oleh kerentanan format hipermarket di mall.",
  "External Factor": "Faktor Eksternal",
  "Response Assessment & Strategic Defense": "Penilaian Daya Tanggap & Pertanggungjawaban Strategis",
  "High responsiveness to digital and fresh demand drivers": "Daya tanggap tinggi terhadap pemicu permintaan digital dan produk segar",
  "Structural headwinds in large mall formats and minimarket scale": "Tantangan struktural pada format mall besar dan skala jaringan minimarket",
  "EFE Matrix Total Weighted Score": "Total Skor Terbobot Matriks EFE",
  "Below average (2.50): Digital agility offset by heavy physical mall exposure.": "Di bawah rata-rata (2,50): Kelincahan digital terbebani oleh paparan gerai fisik mall yang berat.",
  "Section 10 · Internal evaluation": "Bagian 10 · Evaluasi internal",
  "The IFE matrix evaluates MPPA’s internal organizational strengths and weaknesses across operations, finance, merchandising, and format strategy. Total score is 2.21 (below 2.50 benchmark), indicating severe financial and square footage vulnerabilities.": "Matriks IFE mengevaluasi kekuatan dan kelemahan internal organisasi MPPA di bidang operasional, keuangan, perdagangan produk, dan strategi format gerai. Total skor adalah 2,21 (di bawah tolok ukur 2,50), menandakan kerentanan finansial dan beban luasan ruang yang berat.",
  "Internal Factor": "Faktor Internal",
  "Internal Position Assessment & Strategic Rationale": "Penilaian Posisi Internal & Pertimbangan Strategis",
  "Strong operational, fresh supply, and logistics assets": "Aset operasional, pasokan bahan segar, dan logistik yang sangat kuat",
  "Severe liquidity, balance sheet, and oversized format drag": "Beban likuiditas yang parah, neraca keuangan tertekan, dan format gerai terlampau luas",
  "IFE Matrix Total Weighted Score": "Total Skor Terbobot Matriks IFE",
  "Internally weak (2.21 < 2.50): Fresh food moat undermined by financial distress.": "Secara internal lemah (2,21 < 2,50): Parit pertahanan makanan segar tertekan oleh krisis keuangan.",
  "Section 11 · Strategy formulation": "Bagian 11 · Formulasi strategi",
