  "[S2, S7, O1, O8]": "[S2, S7, O1, O8]",
  "Use all 100 Hypermart stores as dispatch hubs for GrabMart, Shopee, and HappyFresh to capture the 54% boom in online grocery buying.": "Manfaatkan 100 gerai Hypermart sebagai pusat pengiriman untuk GrabMart, Shopee, dan HappyFresh guna merebut lonjakan 54% belanja pangan online.",
  "[S1, S4, O3, O7, O10]": "[S1, S4, O3, O7, O10]",
  "Use Hypermart's large chilled distribution centers (66,755 m²) to buy vegetables, fruit, and meat directly from local farmers in bulk.": "Manfaatkan pusat distribusi berpendingin besar Hypermart (66.755 m²) untuk membeli sayur, buah, dan daging langsung dari petani lokal dalam volume besar.",
  "[S3, S6, O4, O5, O6]": "[S3, S6, O4, O5, O6]",
  "Open small, compact Hyfresh stores (500–1,000 m²) close to residential homes, taking advantage of essential food permits during COVID.": "Buka gerai Hyfresh kecil dan kompak (500–1.000 m²) dekat kawasan perumahan, memanfaatkan izin ritel pangan esensial selama COVID.",
  "[S2, S8, O1, O2, O8]": "[S2, S8, O1, O2, O8]",
  "Convert unused backroom floor space inside large hypermarkets into micro-warehouses (dark stores) for Grab drivers to pick up orders in 10 minutes.": "Ubah ruang gudang belakang yang tidak terpakai di hipermarket besar menjadi gudang mikro (dark store) agar kurir Grab dapat mengambil pesanan dalam 10 menit.",
  "[W3, W6, O1, O8]": "[W3, W6, O1, O8]",
  "Rent out 30% to 40% of excess hypermarket retail floor space to other businesses to lower rental costs and stop lease losses.": "Sewakan 30% hingga 40% ruang lantai hipermarket berlebih ke usaha lain guna menekan biaya sewa dan menghentikan kerugian kontrak.",
  "[W4, W8, O2, O3]": "[W4, W8, O2, O3]",
  "Link Hypermart's Hicard with OVO digital wallet points to give loyal shoppers instant rewards instead of burning money on big discounts.": "Hubungkan keanggotaan Hicard Hypermart dengan poin dompet digital OVO untuk memberi poin loyalitas instan daripada membakar uang promosi diskon besar.",
  "[W7, W9, O7, O9, O10]": "[W7, W9, O7, O9, O10]",
  "Sign supply contracts directly with local farm groups to deliver fresh produce straight to chilled warehouses, cutting rot and waste.": "Tandatangani kontrak pasokan langsung dengan kelompok tani lokal untuk mengirim produk segar langsung ke gudang berpendingin, memangkas pembusukan dan sampah pangan.",
  "[W2, W10, O1, O8]": "[W2, W10, O1, O8]",
  "Negotiate discounted commission rates with Grab and delivery apps in exchange for being their biggest exclusive fresh food partner.": "Negosiasikan potongan tarif komisi khusus dengan Grab dan aplikasi pengantaran sebagai imbalan menjadi mitra eksklusif pangan segar terbesar mereka.",
  "[S1, S4, T1, T6]": "[S1, S4, T1, T6]",
  "Sell high-quality fresh beef, chicken, fish, and vegetables that small minimarkets (Indomaret and Alfamart) physically cannot keep in stock.": "Jual daging sapi segar, ayam, ikan, dan sayuran bermutu tinggi yang secara fisik tidak dapat disediakan oleh minimarket kecil (Indomaret dan Alfamart).",
  "[S3, S6, T1, T6]": "[S3, S6, T1, T6]",
  "Expand compact Hyfresh neighborhood supermarkets to prevent Alfamidi from stealing residential grocery shoppers.": "Perluas supermarket perumahan kompak Hyfresh untuk mencegah Alfamidi merebut para pembeli bahan pangan di kawasan pemukiman.",
  "[S4, S10, T2, T3, T8]": "[S4, S10, T2, T3, T8]",
  "Use bulk warehouse purchasing to sell large multi-packs of rice, cooking oil, and sugar at cheaper prices than minimarkets.": "Gunakan pembelian gudang volume besar untuk menjual kemasan multi-pack beras, minyak goreng, dan gula dengan harga lebih murah dibanding minimarket.",
  "[S5, S9, T5, T10]": "[S5, S9, T5, T10]",
  "Partner with sister Lippo businesses — OVO payments, Siloam Hospitals, and Lippo residential towns — to get loyal customers without price wars.": "Bermitra dengan unit usaha Grup Lippo — pembayaran OVO, Rumah Sakit Siloam, dan kawasan pemukiman Lippo — untuk meraih pelanggan setia tanpa perang harga.",
  "[W1, W3, W5, T4, T7]": "[W1, W3, W5, T4, T7]",
  "Speed up closing down chronically unprofitable mall hypermarkets to get rid of expensive PSAK 73 lease debt.": "Percepat penutupan gerai hipermarket mall yang terus merugi kronis guna menghapus beban utang sewa PSAK 73 yang mahal.",
  "[W5, W6, T4, T7]": "[W5, W6, T4, T7]",
  "Renegotiate store leases with mall owners from fixed monthly rent into flexible rent based on a small percentage of monthly sales (3% to 5%).": "Negosiasikan ulang sewa gerai dengan pengelola mall dari sewa bulanan tetap menjadi sewa fleksibel berbasis persentase penjualan bulanan (3% hingga 5%).",
  "[W2, W7, T2, T3, T8]": "[W2, W7, T2, T3, T8]",
  "Sell more in-house Hypermart private label brands for daily pantry items to give shoppers lower prices while earning higher profit margins.": "Jual lebih banyak produk merek privat Hypermart untuk kebutuhan dapur harian guna memberi pembeli harga terjangkau sekaligus raih margin lebih tinggi.",
  "[W1, W2, T2, T9, T10]": "[W1, W2, T2, T9, T10]",
  "Stop burning cash on discount price wars against giant minimarket duopolies (Salim / Alfaria). Focus strictly on profitable fresh foods.": "Hentikan bakar uang perang diskon harga melawan duopoli minimarket raksasa (Salim / Alfaria). Fokus secara tegas pada makanan segar yang menguntungkan.",
  "Sources: Fred David Strategic Management Ch. 6; Case 23; Audited AR2020; Matahari.xlsx Sheet 'SWOT'": "Sumber: Manajemen Strategis Fred David Bab 6; Kasus 23; Laporan Tahunan Teraudit 2020; Lembar 'SWOT' di Matahari.xlsx",
  "Boston HBC": "Boston HBC",
  ". Foodmart and Primo together contributed approximately 10%, while other formats contributed approximately 5%. Hypermart therefore dominates MPPA’s revenue base.": ". Foodmart dan Primo secara bersama menyumbang sekitar 10%, sedangkan format lain menyumbang sekitar 5%. Oleh karena itu, Hypermart mendominasi basis pendapatan MPPA.",
  "Our case concerns MPPA, the company operating Hypermart and several other retail formats in Indonesia. Hypermart is its largest source of revenue, but the company also serves different shopping needs through smaller supermarkets, convenience stores, health and beauty stores, and wholesale. Hypermart is the core revenue-generating format.": "Studi kasus ini membahas MPPA, perusahaan yang mengoperasikan Hypermart dan berbagai format ritel lain di Indonesia. Hypermart adalah sumber pendapatan terbesarnya, namun perusahaan juga melayani kebutuhan belanja berbeda melalui supermarket yang lebih kecil, minimarket, gerai kesehatan dan kecantikan, serta kulakan grosir. Hypermart merupakan format penghasil pendapatan inti.",
